    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main game content provided by this game:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple mechs to choose from</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mech has different performance, handling, and initial abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various types of weapons</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple types of weapons such as Auto-Guns, Main-Guns, and Sub-Guns. Each weapon offers a different experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Guns have a high rate of fire and are good at dealing damage to shields, but have low direct damage to enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Gun bullets cannot collide with enemy bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main-Guns have high power but limited ammunition. Main-Gun bullets can collide with enemy bullets. Through specific loadouts, you can even confront enemies head-on and suppress them with direct fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-Guns have high power and strong bullet-clearing ability, but also have a long cooldown time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various types of allies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones: Stay by your side to protect you at all times but are relatively fragile. They can provide better protection through upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frigates: Move quickly and can chase enemies to attack. They can become excellent wingmen through upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battleships: Have high firepower but poor mobility. They can become fire fortresses through upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose suitable ships to form your own fleet!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collision Damage</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to crash into enemies! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to crash into asteroids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies should also watch out for asteroids~~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When enemy fire is too intense, maybe hide behind asteroids?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Barrages</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your consecutive kill count increases, your firepower will become stronger, and massive bullets will spray out from your muzzle. Go shoot to your heart's content!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main game content provided by this game:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple mechs to choose from</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mech has different performance, handling, and initial abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various types of weapons</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple types of weapons such as Auto-Guns, Main-Guns, and Sub-Guns. Each weapon offers a different experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Guns have a high rate of fire and are good at dealing damage to shields, but have low direct damage to enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Gun bullets cannot collide with enemy bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main-Guns have high power but limited ammunition. Main-Gun bullets can collide with enemy bullets. Through specific loadouts, you can even confront enemies head-on and suppress them with direct fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-Guns have high power and strong bullet-clearing ability, but also have a long cooldown time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various types of allies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones: Stay by your side to protect you at all times but are relatively fragile. They can provide better protection through upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frigates: Move quickly and can chase enemies to attack. They can become excellent wingmen through upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battleships: Have high firepower but poor mobility. They can become fire fortresses through upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose suitable ships to form your own fleet!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collision Damage</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to crash into enemies! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to crash into asteroids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies should also watch out for asteroids~~</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When enemy fire is too intense, maybe hide behind asteroids?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Massive Barrages</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your consecutive kill count increases, your firepower will become stronger, and massive bullets will spray out from your muzzle. Go shoot to your heart's content!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
